{"RunId":"160d53a1-5bd5-46b3-9958-095212a98c94","Seq":26,"Kind":"NodeCompleted","Synthetic":true,"TimestampUtc":"2026-04-25T06:44:35.2980883Z","NodeId":"n_ym05bcg","NodeName":null,"Payload":{"nodeInstanceId":"37e6df29-ec51-4d6b-a3b4-be4831165f92","duration":"PT1M44.7310711S","inputData":{"triggerType":"WebHook","triggerTime":"2026-04-25T06:42:50.5540420Z","webHookMethod":"POST","webHookRoute":"/webhook/investigate-icm","bodyJsonSchema":"{\n   \u0022type\u0022: \u0022object\u0022,\n   \u0022required\u0022: [\u0022incidentId\u0022, \u0022serviceName\u0022, \u0022teamName\u0022, \u0022timestamp\u0022],\n   \u0022properties\u0022: {\n     \u0022incidentId\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022integer\u0022, \u0022format\u0022: \u0022int64\u0022 },\n     \u0022serviceName\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022string\u0022 },\n     \u0022teamName\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022string\u0022 },\n     \u0022timestamp\u0022: { \u0022type\u0022: \u0022string\u0022, \u0022format\u0022: \u0022date-time\u0022 }\n   }\n }","messageType":"json","body.timestamp":"2026-04-25T06:42:37.057Z","body.incidentId":783872773,"body.serviceName":"","body.teamName":"","__webhookBody":"{\n  \u0022incidentId\u0022: 783872773,\n  \u0022serviceName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022teamName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022timestamp\u0022: \u00222026-04-25T06:42:37.057Z\u0022\n}"},"outputData":{"mode":"skill","backend":"copilot","model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","agentName":"open-icm","agentSummary":"","result":"Here\u0027s a summary of findings for **ICM 783872773**:\n\n---\n\n## ICM 783872773 \u2014 Investigation Summary\n\n### Identity\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **Service** | Azure Stack HCI |\n| **Team** | Arc Managed VMs |\n| **Owner** | Michael Duppr\u00E9 (mduppre) |\n| **Status** | \uD83D\uDD34 Active |\n| **Severity** | Sev-3 |\n| **Region** | USGOVVirginia |\n| **Build** | 2602.0.7 (Dell OEM) |\n| **Triggered** | 2026-04-25T06:42:37Z |\n\n---\n\n### Problem Statement\n\nAfter upgrading a cluster from **Azure Local 2512 \u2192 2601**, a new infrastructure LNET (\u0060ceo-clu001-Infra-LNET\u0060) was automatically provisioned with an IP range overlapping the pre-existing \u0060LNET1-Static\u0060.\n\nThe customer then tried to delete an **orphaned NIC** (\u0060arcvm001-NIC\u0060) left behind after its parent VM (\u0060arcvm001\u0060) was deleted from the portal. The deletion is blocked by the admission webhook:\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\ncreateupdatevalidationwebhook.infrastructure.azstackhci.microsoft.com\ndenied the request: The following IP Pool ranges you entered are already in use:\n[10.10.35.52, 10.10.35.61] by ceo-clu001-InfraLNET.\nPlease choose different ranges to avoid conflicts.\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n**Cluster ARM ID:**\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n/subscriptions/f726effd-d97f-48c1-8f47-e0bb67d2fe33\n  /resourceGroups/choliv-test-rg\n  /providers/microsoft.azurestackhci/clusters/ceo-clu001\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n---\n\n### Root Cause\n\nThe **\u0060createupdatevalidationwebhook\u0060** is incorrectly triggering on a **DELETE** operation and running IP pool conflict validation logic that is only meaningful for CREATE/UPDATE. Since the infra LNET auto-created during the 2601 upgrade occupies IPs that overlap the orphaned NIC\u0027s pool, the webhook blocks cleanup \u2014 resulting in a resource stuck in an unresolvable state from the portal.\n\n**Two contributing factors:**\n1. **Webhook fires on DELETE** \u2014 IP conflict validation should not block resource deletion.\n2. **2601 upgrade auto-creates infra LNET with overlapping IPs** \u2014 no overlap check against existing LNETs during upgrade.\n\n---\n\n### Impact\n\nLow \u2014 this is an **internal Dell stamp** used for testing. No production workloads are affected.\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Next Steps\n\n| Priority | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| \uD83D\uDD25 **Immediate** | Provide a manual workaround \u2014 directly patch/delete the NIC resource via \u0060kubectl\u0060 or ARM API bypassing the webhook (e.g., label the resource to skip validation or use a break-glass delete) |\n| \uD83D\uDD27 **Short-term** | Fix the webhook to **not run IP pool range validation on DELETE** operations \u2014 deletion should never be gated on IP conflicts |\n| \uD83D\uDD27 **Short-term** | Investigate why the 2601 upgrade created \u0060ceo-clu001-Infra-LNET\u0060 with IPs overlapping \u0060LNET1-Static\u0060 \u2014 the upgrade path should check for conflicts before auto-provisioning |\n| \uD83D\uDCCB **Tracking** | File a bug against the \u0060createupdatevalidationwebhook\u0060 to only intercept \u0060CREATE\u0060/\u0060UPDATE\u0060 verbs, not \u0060DELETE\u0060 |\n\n---\n\n[OUTPUT:incidentFolder] E:\\icms\\Azure_Stack_HCI\\Arc_Managed_VMs\\783872773\n[OUTPUT:summary.md] 1 KB\n[OUTPUT:discussion.md] 380 KB\n[OUTPUT:rca.md] 3 KB\n[OUTPUT:metadata.md] 1 KB\n[OUTPUT:ai_summary.md]","ai.success":true,"ai.model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","ai.durationMs":91544,"ai.inputTokens":227741,"ai.outputTokens":2682,"incidentFolder":"E:\\icms\\Azure_Stack_HCI\\Arc_Managed_VMs\\783872773","summary.md":"1 KB","discussion.md":"380 KB","rca.md":"3 KB","metadata.md":"1 KB"},"globalVariables":{"maxQueryScore":0,"body.timestamp":"2026-04-25T06:42:37.057Z","codeIssueFile":"","agentFolder":"E:\\work\\hub\\docs\\wiki","__webhookBody":"{\n  \u0022incidentId\u0022: 783872773,\n  \u0022serviceName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022teamName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022timestamp\u0022: \u00222026-04-25T06:42:37.057Z\u0022\n}","repoMdFile":"E:\\work\\hub\\docs\\wiki\\repos.md","body.incidentId":783872773,"rcaFile":"","metadataFile":"","body.serviceName":"","discussionFile":"","mitigationStepsFile":"","body.teamName":"","rootRepoFolder":"E:\\work","incidentId":0,"queryLoopCount":0,"applicableTsgFile":"","incidentFolder":"","etwEventsFile":"","summaryFile.md":"","issueListFile":""}}}
